                            <p>With over 15 years of experience, Dr. Saurabh Jain specializes in internal medicine, diabetes, hypertension, and cardiac care. He consults at Naivaidya Healthcare and is affiliated with Sir HN Reliance Foundation, Jaslok, and Cumballa Hill Hospital.
                                <br>A former physician with the Indian Air Force and Railways, he holds advanced certifications from Boston University and RCP, UK. He is an active member of IMA, API, ASE, and the Jain Doctors Association, and regularly contributes to medical conferences and research.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="best-doctor-outer">
                        <div class="image">
